{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act42side_level_act42side_04_end",
  "groupId": "act42side",
  "stageId": "act42side_04",
  "title": "求道",
  "storyCode": "MT-4",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act42side/level_act42side_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "0e6859464714b3bd4dd47a73192f5e1a01d5b77e2fda47d32d127bc3e6b21eb9",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖堂巡邏守衛",
      "text": "這位公民，如果你是來觀摩降生儀式的，請去廣場那邊的等候通道接受檢查。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖堂巡邏守衛",
      "text": "……我看你在附近觀望很久了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "text": "啊，對不起！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "text": "我只是在等人……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖堂巡邏守衛",
      "text": "是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖堂巡邏守衛",
      "text": "今天進出聖堂的人很多，請配合我們的規定，不要在此逗留。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "text": "對不起！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "text": "小樂姐已經進去整整一天了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "text": "按照原計劃，她只需要炸毀聖堂裡的重要建築結構，讓那個什麼儀式無法如期舉辦就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "text": "這個時間點，她應該已經出來了才對……難道被發現了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "text": "不對不對，我一直守在這附近，裡面明明什麼動靜都沒有……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "text": "不管怎麼樣，小樂姐肯定遇到了一些意外，沒辦法脫身……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "text": "梵妮，快想想快想想，你能做點什麼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "text": "我身上還剩兩小管源石火藥，可以組裝成一個簡易炸彈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "text": "雖然實際的威力可能沒那麼大，但足以搞出一些動靜，吸引那些衛兵的注意力，讓小樂姐能夠……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "text": "就安裝在這裡好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "text": "呼——暫時沒人注意到這裡，那麼只需要引爆——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一截銃管托住了梵里妮的手臂，使她無法再往下移動哪怕一寸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "別讓這個小玩意“砰”出聲，孩子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "慢慢站起來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "text": "銃、銃騎……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "text": "看你這套裝扮，你是銃械工坊的工匠？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "text": "我還有十分鐘的空閒時間。孩子，可以向我解釋這一切嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "text": "你想做什麼？或者說，你在掩護誰？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "text": "走吧，小樂姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "潘大師呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "text": "老師已經睡著了。他最近視力又變差了，醫生叮囑他早點休息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "text": "我們動作輕一點，應該不會吵醒他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "梵妮，先別急。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "text": "小樂姐，你幹嘛這麼一本正經地說話，好、好不習慣啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "咳咳，聽好了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "如果你不小心被抓住了，不管對方是戍衛隊、執行者還是銃騎，千萬不要講什麼義氣，直接把我供出來就好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "你只是在一個月黑風高的晚上突然被我踹開門脅迫著做了一些炸彈，被我逼著在聖堂外面把風而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "你什麼都不知情，只是一個無辜的小天使！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "text": "啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "這是我答應你跟我一起行動的條件哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "text": "小樂姐，我只是有點怕生，並不是膽小！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "哈哈我知道。你願意幫我，我已經很開心了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "教皇廳好像非常非常看重那個儀式，很難說因此觸犯律法的人，會受到什麼樣的懲罰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "更何況現在的拉特蘭，和我記憶中的很不一樣了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "text": "我……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "好了好了，我一個人就夠了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "再說了，企鵝物流的企業文化是——能一個人出的風頭絕不分給兩個人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "text": "（搖頭）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "text": "我、我是一個人來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "text": "有趣的孩子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "text": "我這樣的老傢伙，和年輕人聊天的機會不多。可惜，儀式就要開始了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "text": "你不肯說的話，我只能將你移交給公證所的執行者了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "帕特里奇昂，住手！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "別以為你躲在鐵皮後面，我就看不到你假惺惺的嘴臉了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "咳咳……咳，累死我了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "text": "潘？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "等等，聖城的異樣啊什麼的，你們兩個好像突然之間就心領神會了……你們不打算跟我解釋一下嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "這與我們的調查沒有關係，修女。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "我暫時無法作出你應當知曉更多事情的判斷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "不管怎麼樣，阿爾圖羅小姐，請跟我們回去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "老實說，我並不討厭，甚至有點喜歡你。但如果你讓蘭登修道院受到損害，我、我不會放過你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "席德佳修女，可以問你一個問題嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "你深愛著修道院，深愛著拉特蘭，對嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "或者我應該這麼問，身為黎博利，你是如何建立起與拉特蘭的情感連結的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "呃……我在蘭登修道院生活很久了，從小就受修道院的叔叔阿姨們照顧，我們一起做麵包釀啤酒，為了修道院不破產東奔西走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "我屬於這裡，我當然愛這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "如果你是問為什麼聖城會有那麼多黎博利……阿爾圖羅小姐，你讀過那本《聖徒行記》的吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "難道說，你只是拿它摺了紙蜻蜓……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "按照《聖徒行記》的說法，黎博利與拉特蘭的相遇，其實要從一群馱獸講起。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "不知道多少年前，幾十個黎博利在荒野上尋覓水源時被一群馱獸衝散，那些動物背負著成捆的糧食，結成整齊的隊伍奔向遠方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "黎博利為了獵殺馱獸，往往要費很多很多功夫，他們從未見過這些屬於荒野的精靈如此有跡可循，便一路尾隨著牠們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "然後，黎博利看見了田地間頭頂光環的人們，他們一邊唱著歌，一邊聚集引導著馱獸隊伍，走入身後潔白的建築中。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "在黎博利還衣不蔽體，只能逐水草而居的時候，那群人便已經學會了馴化野生動物，建造不受天災侵襲的城市。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "更重要的是，黎博利發現那群人還有著他們難以理解的自信和樂觀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "因為光環，因為“共感”……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "嗯嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "他們生來便能互相感受、互相理解，因此少有矛盾。他們能夠解決一切足以摧毀荒野上其他族群的危機。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "他們由此建立起了完善的秩序，以“律法”為名。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "我能明白那種感覺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "我的記憶裡，儘管教皇廳已經中斷了對修道院的補助，儘管房屋已經殘破不堪，儘管我無數次對著厚厚的帳本苦惱不已……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "但薩科塔叔叔阿姨們好像從來沒有想過，蘭登修道院真有倒閉的一天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "他們的自信與樂觀，甚至讓他們能夠接納不屬於族群的黎博利留在附近，學習他們的一切，成為他們的一部分。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "是啊，漫長的時間裡，除了光環無法分享，薩科塔幾乎已經完全同化了聖城裡的黎博利。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "我們太過特別，特別到能夠吸納一切……就像一首主調清晰的協奏曲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "費迪，從一開始，拉特蘭便不只是薩科塔們的溫馨小屋。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "你越獄後專門去移動修道院打探“失蹤的孕婦”——我查看過公證所的資料，近期並無失蹤人口相關的報案記錄。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "阿爾圖羅，你需要對該行為進行解釋。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "一位可憐的母親消失在了拉特蘭，這是一起無人會在意的失蹤案……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "因極其偶然的機會，我曾在麥田間演奏時，觸碰到她的心聲——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "我終於查到她去了哪裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "你是說……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "別急。等等看，費迪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "已經到了這裡，不需要我來為你說明了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "text": "這是後來你收養的那個孩子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "真不好意思，銃騎大人，我身上沒帶領養文件。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "怎麼，只許你收養黎博利，不許我收養薩科塔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "這是一個好孩子。反正除了你之外，我倒是沒發現和薩科塔交心有這麼難。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "text": "你這張嘴啊……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "text": "潘，我們有多久沒見面了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "忘了，沒往前想過。不過我本來以為往後也是沒必要的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "text": "……那麼，言歸正傳吧。你的學徒剛剛試圖——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "我指使她來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "text": "目的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "示威啊，很難理解嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "教皇廳一口氣關閉了全城上百間銃械工坊，我做了幾十年的工作，我指望養老的那間小店鋪，就這麼莫名其妙地沒了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "聽說今天你們要在這裡開派對，我想說搞出一點動靜，讓貴賓們感受一下怒火，讓教皇廳給我這個公民一點說法！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "說實話，我本來應該自己來的，但年紀大了腿腳不靈活了眼神不靈光了，只好讓這個孩子跑一趟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "text": "潘，我以為你早就改行了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "呃，別開玩笑了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "吉雅被你趕出拉特蘭後，直到如今你還敢用我做的這把銃，我為什麼要改行？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "我只是不再專門為你們這些銃騎服務了而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "text": "……也是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "這件事，你打算怎麼處理？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "在育嬰聖堂前搞爆炸，試圖破壞降生儀式，被你當場抓獲……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "為了保證樂園的純潔，身為銃騎的你，是不是應該再一次把自己的朋友“送”出拉特蘭？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "好巧不巧，他又是一個黎博利。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "text": "這和你是不是黎博利沒有關係，潘。如果你們真的觸犯了律法，我恐怕得再體驗一次離別。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "text": "但這次不是及時發現，沒有釀成實際的後果嗎，哈哈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "text": "帶你的學徒回去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "走了，梵妮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "（扶我一下，急著出門，忘了換你幫我新配的眼鏡了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃騎",
      "text": "閣下，這個人的說法很明顯漏洞百出。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "text": "我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃騎",
      "text": "依照最保險的做法，我們應該將師徒兩人帶回審問，排除風險……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "text": "沒必要這麼大費周章……而且，我確實不想再和那個老傢伙起衝突。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "text": "看這個粗糙的小炸彈，那個孩子顯然是臨時起意……也就是說，她的同夥還在裡面。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "text": "再調一隊銃騎過來，配合聖堂巡邏守衛加強戒備。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃騎",
      "text": "瞭解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "text": "……奇怪，難道還在育嬰聖堂裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "text": "阿摩斯輔佐官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "text": "帕特里奇昂閣下……好、好久不見。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "text": "好久不見。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "text": "看你著急慌忙的樣子，怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "text": "請問您看到蕾繆安樞機了嗎？我有點事情想要向她確認。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "text": "她來育嬰聖堂執行公務，一直沒有返回第七廳……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "text": "如果是和那場爆炸有關，你需要向我同步報告。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "text": "……我明白了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "text": "此前去接收法柏爾區博爾戈街的銃械工坊時，我偶遇了一位薩科塔，後來向樞機彙報時，她明顯察覺到了一些異樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "text": "根據此人的外形特徵，我比對了所有設籍公民的資料，在外出人員資料庫裡發現了一個相符的人選。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "text": "此人先前應該也曾出現在司提望區的爆炸現場，她……她和樞機之間具有某種特別的關聯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "text": "哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "……我的時間不多，修女，我得儘快趕回育嬰聖堂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修女",
      "text": "容我最後確認，您並不確定照顧的對象會死亡，卻打算提前為她預訂一場葬禮？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "是的……她的情況不容樂觀，身為保育員，我應當竭盡所能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "但這並不妨礙我做最悲觀的打算。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修女",
      "text": "這樣的行事風格，真不像是拉特蘭人啊……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "拉特蘭人，應該是什麼樣子的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修女",
      "text": "呃……還真是個傷腦筋的問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "那麼，再見——不，希望我們不需要再見。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "他們通知我的時候我還不信——安多恩，你竟然真的回到了這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "這間安魂教堂，這片鳶尾花田，熟悉嗎？或者說，懷念嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "拉特蘭的安魂教堂數量並不算少。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "至於說懷念……我現在的工作，恐怕不適合對安魂教堂有這樣的情緒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我都忘了，你現在是最受器重的保育員！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "所以，請問您是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "之前跟蹤我的，潛入聖堂襲擊我的，都是你們？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "“跟蹤”？“襲擊”？安多恩，是你瘋了還是我瘋了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "如果不希望我們與你同路，當初又為什麼要把“尋路者”之名交予我們？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "那座吃人不眨眼的詭異聖堂，究竟是你尋得的正道，還是你誤入的歧途？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "在遇到牧首之前，我並不記得曾承諾過與誰同路……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "至於育嬰聖堂，它確實為我指明了一條道路。但“吃人不眨眼”？你一定是誤解了什麼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "好了，安多恩，別*拉特蘭俚語*裝傻！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我們的十幾位手足再也沒能走出那座聖堂！如果你尋得的路途需要我們犧牲，你至少應該提前告訴我們……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "或者，如果你真的無恥到只是想否認我們之間的關係，那你也至少應該直接說出來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "不，我不明白……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "那你接下來有的是時間慢慢搞明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "請別這樣做，有很多孩子需要我照顧，還有那位母親……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "咳咳，嘶——該死！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "是她們，先撤退。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "菲亞梅塔，你開炮的時候真沒想到要避開安多恩啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "他向來命大，死不了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "菲亞梅塔、莫斯提馬……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "安多恩，看來你的仇人還真不少。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "我去追，你和他聊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "不必了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "雖然不明白這群人為什麼屢次對我下手，但我隱約覺得……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "他們很堅定。這樣的人一般都有著複雜的經歷與單純的渴求。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "你還真有慈悲心啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "那為什麼能對自己的隊友下那樣的狠手呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "為什麼你不肯對莫斯提馬和蕾繆安懺悔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "為什麼你不肯告訴我們，當年在地宮深處，鎖與匙裡的那個傢伙究竟讓你看到了什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "為什麼，你從來不肯告訴我們答案？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "準確的說，是和我們分享問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "……菲亞梅塔，我們都有自己的路要走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "你的路，就是指發瘋打傷蕾繆安，不負責任地逃走，再突然跟著那個牧首回來，心安理得地躲在育嬰聖堂接受她的庇佑？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "你消失的那幾年，究竟得到了什麼救贖啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "我不曾得到救贖，也從不心安理得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "只是生命太過短暫，如果不能及早找到我所求的答案，我的罪行與你們的傷痛都會變得毫無意義。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "從蘭登修道院刑滿釋放的第二天，我就離開了拉特蘭，自以為能找到些什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "對於之後五年裡發生的事，我的印象很模糊，只記得自己去到一個地方，再到下一個地方，一個人，很多不知終點的方向……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "我時常懷疑，是不是自己的記憶出了問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "所幸我遇到了牧首。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "她那時正在前往聖城的旅途之中，雖然已經因一路救死扶傷而耽擱了不知多少時日。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "是她讓我相信，答案仍在拉特蘭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "她向我許諾，一個奇蹟，而後千千萬萬的奇蹟，將因我們而誕生。我回到拉特蘭，只為與她共同履行這個諾言。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "你還是別說了。顛三倒四，自說自話，煩死了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "聽著，安多恩。那天的聚會，我把你趕了出去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "之後帕特里奇昂花了很長的時間，試圖告訴我——你，你們那座聖堂，你們即將舉辦的那場儀式的重要性啊什麼的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "我從來沒見老頭子那麼正式過，所以我答應了他，暫時不和你計較。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "救你，不是因為我原諒了你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "只是在你為當年的事情真正懺悔並付出代價之前，你沒有資格死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "安多恩，降生儀式快開始了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "抱歉，我得走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "text": "……早安。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "text": "諸位同胞、歸鄉的信使、來自泰拉諸國的使者、經由修道院第一次踏入聖城的客人們，請允許我向你們致意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "text": "我們身處的這座聖堂，並非拉特蘭為了迎合“萬國峰會”，故作姿態地展示財力與奇觀而建。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "text": "但它能趕在這個盛事期間落成，能讓各位今天齊聚於此，我感到由衷的喜悅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "text": "每一次新生，都會帶來全新的可能……關於如何延續信仰，關於如何對抗災異。唯有如此，我們才能塑造未來的形貌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "text": "在今後的拉特蘭，更是如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "text": "希望大家做好準備，聆聽新的心跳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
